# Copy into a shell. Do not commit real keys. Do not create a .env in this repo.
# Chain id, RPC, the tUSD8 address, and decimals are read from packages/sdk/src/config.ts.
# Do not paste the token address here. On Aevum (chain id 44005) Deploy.s.sol uses that
# token, checks decimals(), and refuses to deploy MockTUSD8.
# DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY defaults to Anvil account #0 when unset (local only).

# DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# OWNER_ADDRESS=
# ARBITER_ADDRESS=
# Local chains only. On Aevum, any value other than the SDK token is rejected.
# TUSD8_ADDRESS=

# Keystore password for the float CLI. Never pass it as an argument.
# FLOAT_PASSWORD=
